      "Top 20 Features Selected: ['HighBP', 'GenHlth', 'HighChol', 'CholCheck', 'HeartDiseaseorAttack', 'Stroke', 'HvyAlcoholConsump', 'Age', 'DiffWalk', 'BMI', 'Sex', 'AnyHealthcare', 'Smoker', 'PhysHlth', 'Income', 'Education', 'Fruits', 'MentHlth', 'PhysActivity', 'NoDocbcCost']\n",
